      "value": "<p>T his section presents twelve subclasses to be used by players to make heroes flavored to fit the setting of Grimnir. Barbarian Path of the Provoked Though the farmers and smiths of the Tvar are often considered among the most cordial of the raiders, when pushed too hard, the Provoked Barbarian retaliates swiftly and with no measure of mercy. Some who have witnessed such unleashed carnage swear they see two warriors, standing back-to-back.</p>"
